---
import GlobalLayout from "../layouts/global.astro";
---

<GlobalLayout>
	<main class="bg-black w-screen min-h-screen px-60 pt-40">
		<h1 class="text-white font-serif text-7xl tracking-widest mb-8">
			dear hack clubber,
		</h1>
		<p class="text-white font-serif text-4xl leading-12">
			every good hacker has a magnum opus.
			<br />
			an idea that's been living in their head rent-free for ages, but that
			they've convinced theselves that they can't do.
			<br />
			maybe because you don't know how, or you should study for your APs instead,
			or you think you're not smart enough to pull it off.
			<br />
			sometimes, ideas go years, even decades, before they're acted upon. all
			because we're just scared of starting. of failing.
		</p>
		<br />
		<p class="text-white font-serif text-4xl leading-12">
			this summer, we want you to make your idea a reality.
			<br />
			<br />
			join a passionate community of hackers, makers, artists and dreamers just
			like you. over seven weeks, you'll hack on your project alongside 100+
			of your fellow Hack Clubbers. you'll learn new skills, make lifelong friends,
			and walk away with a finished project that you're proud to share with
			the world.
			<br />
			<br />
			w
		</p>
	</main>
</GlobalLayout>
